{"synopsis":"Ini adalah dunia di mana para Awakened hidup berdampingan dengan binatang buas Zhang Ping cukup beruntung untuk menjadi seorang Awakened tetapi kemampuannya dinilai tidak berguna Tidak mau menjalani kehidupan yang biasabiasa saja dia menelan Permata Perjanjian yang dihindari orang biasa dan mengontrak dirinya sendiri menjadi binatang yang dipanggilnya sendiri Sejak saat itu seluruh dunia meluas di hadapannya Kemampuan yang selalu berubah binatang buas yang tak ada habisnya dan dunia paralel yang berbahaya semuanya mungkin terjadi","alternative_title":"I Made a Contract With Myself 我契约了我自己","author":"Meng Yue Culture","artist":"Meng Yue Culture","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1625f463-5b82-48ff-a164-9a1fe63d912c","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"","date":"2025-04-14","released":"2025-04-14"},{"chapter_id":"3bb8225a-fce1-48a6-8c0c-ff17b1cb57cc","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2025-04-11","released":"2025-04-11"},{"chapter_id":"756d41f0-690c-45b0-b458-6eff30e83c1e","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"","date":"2025-03-21","released":"2025-03-21"},{"chapter_id":"90826aa7-aa69-48f7-882b-750028d83f74","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"","date":"2025-03-20","released":"2025-03-20"},{"chapter_id":"52dff22f-c0cf-4032-a8ba-173d1a796638","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"","date":"2025-03-20","released":"2025-03-20"},{"chapter_id":"0b2ead2e-3a75-49b6-ae1b-72145e7b9010","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"","date":"2025-03-19","released":"2025-03-19"},{"chapter_id":"dea0c2dc-405e-4622-acfa-d045b37c0b52","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"","date":"2025-03-18","released":"2025-03-18"},{"chapter_id":"404ec504-2878-490e-9758-2232f8667bb5","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2025-03-17","released":"2025-03-17"},{"chapter_id":"c65080cf-31f3-4463-8873-44a3fd8a175e","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2025-03-16","released":"2025-03-16"},{"chapter_id":"f25dd842-45c5-4fa7-b2d8-754b40202610","number":"75","chapter":"75